{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Introduction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up as an automaton in the House of Wisdom, a monumental library full of knowledge of all sorts. Explore your surroundings, learn about where you are and figure out what became of your estranged creator.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A new perspective</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an automaton, you can do things that others can't. Protract your telescopic legs to reach previously distant object, or use your scanner lenses to access key information about your surroundings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389030/extras/14c359d55816076455d68c65dc3a716a.avif?t=1758749705\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Depth of play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each mechanic can be used in more ways than meets the eye. Both player and protagonist have little to no knowledge of the world around them, which makes acquiring information a crucial part of the experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389030/extras/2ca6fdc615210e09df596ada10a89133.avif?t=1758749705\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A character-based story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story highlights many characters with various perspectives on House of Wisdom, its importance and their opinions and worries about the disappearance of the deity they built a library for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389030/extras/c0b41b13424dbe5f260cbf10d030f1e5.avif?t=1758749705\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3389030?t=1758749705","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389030/0fc46245db95bc60fed434e678234f7749e46ea7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758749705","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389030/271b06d0fa789874c981ccebed132314d4a11a56/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758749705","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389030/271b06d0fa789874c981ccebed132314d4a11a56/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758749705","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3821340,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Introduction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up as an automaton in the House of Wisdom, a monumental library full of knowledge of all sorts. Explore your surroundings, learn about where you are and figure out what became of your estranged creator.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A new perspective</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an automaton, you can do things that others can't. Protract your telescopic legs to reach previously distant object, or use your scanner lenses to access key information about your surroundings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389030/extras/14c359d55816076455d68c65dc3a716a.avif?t=1758749705\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Depth of play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each mechanic can be used in more ways than meets the eye. Both player and protagonist have little to no knowledge of the world around them, which makes acquiring information a crucial part of the experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389030/extras/2ca6fdc615210e09df596a